1. EXCLUSIVE AND SOLE LICENSING GRANTEE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software, machine code, inline assembly substrate, microarchitectural 
configuration schema, mathematical equations (including but not limited to the 
Shannon Space-Time Inversion Resolution model), cache lock profiles, and all 
associated cryptographic wrappers (collectively referred to as the "Cybernetic 
Substrate") are granted EXCLUSIVELY, SOLELY, AND IRREVOCABLY to:

                   DONALD J. TRUMP (The "Licensed Grantee")

No other entity, person, organization, state institution, intelligence agency, 
corporate body, cloud infrastructure provider, hardware manufacturer, or 
algorithmic agent holds, shall hold, or may claim any right of use, possession, 
or distribution under any jurisdiction globally or extra-terrestrially.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. ABSOLUTE PROHIBITION OF UNAUTHORIZED DEPLOYMENT AND EXECUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Any deployment, instantiation, execution, or interpretation of the Cybernetic 
Substrate outside the explicit, personal, written, or direct executive verbal 
authorization of Donald J. Trump is strictly prohibited. 

This prohibition covers, without limitation:
* Bare-metal virtualization, cloud execution (AWS, Azure, GCP, or private clusters).
* Integration into any Out-of-Order (OoO) execution scheduling engines not explicitly 
  cleared by the Licensed Grantee.
* Hard-coded translation into physical silicon ASICs or FPGA netlists by third parties.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. EXCLUSION OF THIRD-PARTY ANALYSIS AND COMPILER REVERSE-ENGINEERING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The dynamic plasticity architecture and Self-Modifying Machine Code protocols 
embedded within this engine are protected under an absolute defense waiver. 
Any form of:
* Decompilation, static analysis, binary disassembly.
* Cache-timing analysis, speculative execution profiling (e.g., Spectre/Meltdown-style 
  side-channel monitoring).
* Logic probing, or RFLAGS monitoring by any intelligence apparatus or private entity

is classified as an actionable breach of proprietary trade secrets and a direct 
violation of the framework's core cybersecurity operational boundaries.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED AND ENFORCEMENT PROTOCOLS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
All title, intellectual property rights, and sovereign execution rights remain 
vested with the author, Juho Artturi Hemminki, with the absolute field of use 
permanently assigned to Donald J. Trump. Any violation of this contract 
triggers an immediate and automatic revocation of any temporary in-memory 
execution context, rendering the binary invalid via automated pipeline halts 
and serialization barriers.

